  unitName: "Nozomi (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 30765
  unitNumber: 1329
  description: A Hunter from another world. The balance of power was shifted through
    Flynn's actions, eventually destroying the delicate state of the world's order.
    Humans and demons alike then suffered the aftermath of this event, and began
    to change. Discarding her past as a Hunter who targeted demons, Nozomi is now
    said to live alongside the fairies. She is even rumored to be their queen, though
    the notion that a human could ever rule over such wild creatures seems ludicrous
    to most. Regardless, the truth behind her story can only be uncovered in the
    depths of the forest.
  summonDesc: I am Nozomi,<br>the human Queen of Fairies.<br>Nice to meet you!
  fusionDesc: I'm happy you came to me for help,<br>but, umm...<br>Sure, why not.<br>I'll
    give you a hand!
  evoDesc: I must be a softy.<br>I don't usually go this far for anyone, even if
    they ask!
